// @FIGURE_CODE_BEGIN
// ── Element spec ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// base slab top  → BoxGeometry(8, 0.4, 2.2) gold #d9a83a, top face y=0
// base slab front → same box, red #cc3322 front face (use multi-material)
// cylinder glass → CylinderGeometry(0.42, 0.42, 4.0, 32, 1, true) transparent #cfe0ea opacity 0.25
